### 1. Lägg till en bok.
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sagan om ringen",
  "author": "J.R.R. Tolkien",
  "publishedDate": "1954-07-29"
}


### 2. Hämta alla böcker.
GET {{host}}/api/books
Accept: application/json


### 3. Hämta en bok.
GET {{host}}/api/books/2
Accept: application/json


### 4. Uppdatera en bok.
PUT {{host}}/api/books/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sagan om ringen (rev)",
  "author": "J.R.R. Tolkien",
  "publishedDate": "1954-07-29"
}


### 5. Radera en bok.
DELETE {{host}}/api/books/2

### 6. Registrera en användare
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "kofi",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### 7. Logga in.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "kofi",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### 8. Books utan token → förväntar 401 Unauthorized
GET {{host}}/api/books

### 9. Books med giltig token → förväntar 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Hämta alla citat. 
GET {{host}}/api/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Lägg till ett citat. 
POST {{host}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "text": "Stay hungry, stay foolish",
  "author": "Steve Jobs"
}

### 12. Uppdatera ett citat
PUT {{host}}/api/quotes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "text": "Stay hungry, stay foolish. Uppdaterad.",
  "author": "Steve Jobs"
}

### 13. Radera ett citat
DELETE {{host}}/api/quotes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}